    <Description>Hero: Legion Commander


Second skill (Press the Attack) must be set to Cast Mode = Quick Cast (W)

Key Bindings Required
Blink Dagger: Space


Blade Mail: Alt + S


First Skill (Overwhelming Odds): Q

When the macro key is pressed, it performs the following sequence:
1.

Blink Dagger to target position
2.

Activate Blade Mail
3.Cast Overwhelming Odds

Manual Cast "R" or Duel as the timing ensures Blade Mail is activated before Duel, maximizing reflected damage during the duel.

Usage:
Press the assigned macro key.


The script will automatically execute the combo in the correct order.


Make sure your cursor is over the target when activating the macro.

Notes

:
Designed for fast Legion Commander initiation combos.


Helps reduce manual input delay during fights.


Recommended to test in demo mode or bot matches first to verify key bindings.</Description>
